conflicts.description:
The conflicted paths both change (at most 100;
`conflicts_truncated` beyond, or when paths an AI agent is not
given were left out).

event_types.description:
`*` (every integration-class event, the default), a family
(`merge_request.*`) of the integration class, or an exact type name;
a maintainer- or deployment-class type only by its name; 1..=64.

protected_only.description:
Give it only to pipelines of protected branches (default `true`;
today every value goes only to a push pipeline of a protected
branch, ADR-0029).
